  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support for achieving a sustainable phytosanitary sector aligned gradually to the EU organizational, institutional, and regulatory standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The second area of support aims to secure gradual alignment of Kosovo&#xBF;s phytosanitary sector to the EU&#xBF;s organisational, institutional and regulatory standards both legally and practically through the development of methods, operational procedures and technical capacities of the plant protection laboratories in line with the applicable EU and international standards.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
